# Tool split layout

Pages with filters/form plus a table or result use `.tool-split`.

- Left `.tool-split-controls`: month, type, sides, form fields, submit
- Right `.tool-split-result`: log, table, calculated output
- Do not put those controls in a full-width `.calc-toolbar`
- Desktop (992px+): left column is sticky so inputs stay usable while results scroll
- Below 992px: stack controls above results
- Table headers still use `.calc-table` + `bindCalcSticky` (no `data-calc-toolbar`)

```html
<section class="tool-hero">...</section>
<div class="tool-split">
  <div class="tool-split-controls">...</div>
  <div class="tool-split-result">...</div>
</div>
```
